==== TFTP Boot ====

Setup U-Boot tftp settings, load "initramfs" and boot up OpenWrt.

<code>
> setenv ipaddr 192.168.1.1
> setenv netmask 255.255.255.0
> setenv serverip 192.168.1.100
> setenv ethact egiga1
> setenv ethprime egiga1
> tftpboot solidrun_clearfog-pro-a1-initramfs-kernel.bin
[..]
> bootm
[..]
</code>

After successful boot copy "solidrun_clearfog-base-a1-squashfs-sdcard.img.gz" or "solidrun_clearfog-pro-a1-squashfs-sdcard.img.gz" to the System and sysupgrade.

<code>
root@OpenWrt# sysupgrade -v /tmp/solidrun_clearfog-pro-a1-squashfs-sdcard.img.gz
[..]
</code>


